#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_purchase_cost
msgid ""
"If linked to a lot, takes the lot's purchase cost "
"(quant.lot_id.purchase_price). Otherwise, uses the product's standard price "
"(quant.product_id.standard_price)."
msgstr ""
"Si está vinculado a un lote, toma el precio unitario de compra del lote "
"(quant.lot_id.purchase_price). De lo contrario, utiliza el precio estándar "
"del producto (quant.product_id.standard_price)."

#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_purchase_cost
msgid "Lot Purchase Cost"
msgstr "Coste compra lote"

#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_purchase_value
msgid "Lot Purchase Value"
msgstr "Valor compra lote"

#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__product_cost
msgid "Product Cost"
msgstr "Coste producto"

#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_purchase_value
msgid ""
"Quant quantity multiplied by the lot purchase cost (quant.quantity * "
"quant.lot_purchase_cost)."
msgstr ""
"Cantidad de existencias multiplicada por el coste de compra del lote "
"(quant.quantity * quant.lot_purchase_cost)."

